@camera K19
<<if $ch05_told_the_smith>>
    Garo [neutral]: I fold them for anyone now. Takes my mind off the tongs. #line:ch18_pemakar_001
    Garo [soft_smile]: You still fold like a man who ties knots. #line:ch18_pemakar_002
<<else>>
    Townsfolk as "Boat-Folder" [neutral]: Mooring rings, for the little boats. The smith makes them now. #line:ch18_pemakar_003
